56
00:02:55.027 --> 00:02:58.741
So a prompt injection in the
context of building a system with

57
00:02:58.741 --> 00:03:02.455
a language model is when a
user attempts to manipulate the AI

58
00:03:02.455 --> 00:03:05.241
system by providing
input that tries to override or

59
00:03:05.241 --> 00:03:07.098
bypass the intended
