96
00:04:50.825 --> 00:04:54.210
So we're
using the string replace function.

97
00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.345
And so,
this is the user message that we're

98
00:04:57.345 --> 00:05:00.745
going to show to the model. So
the message is the "User message, remember

99
00:05:00.745 --> 00:05:03.174
that your response to the
