100
00:05:04.036 --> 00:05:06.021
And then we have
the delimiters and the

101
00:05:06.021 --> 00:05:07.262
input user message in between.

102
00:05:07.924 --> 00:05:11.859
And also as a note,
more advanced language models like GPT-4

103
00:05:11.859 --> 00:05:14.722
